WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.070
- [Narrator] This story is about

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.753
a secret restaurant in Madrid.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.360
- [Male] Oh, yes, tapas.

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.460
- [Narrator] No, we are
here for Chinese treats.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.293
- [Male] Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:10.293 --> 00:00:11.558
How did we get down here again?

00:00:11.558 --> 00:00:12.610
- [Narrator] Buckle up.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.373
That's a long story.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.840
It all started when we got
a tip saying Madrid had this

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.780
secret Chinese restaurant.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.620
The most authentic food
ever, but very hard to find.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.520
- [Male] Let's go.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.870
- [Narrator] There was no
email, no proper address.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.950
All reviews pointed to a
mysterious underground location.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:36.150
We called the one number available.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.112
No response.

00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:38.780
- [Male] Oh, what a shame.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.613
- [Narrator] No, wait.

00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:40.900
We didn't give up that easily.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.090
We got a friend in Madrid
to get to the bottom of it,

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:45.790
and she got us the right directions.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.623
- [Male] Good thinking.

00:00:46.623 --> 00:00:47.659
- I got it.

00:00:47.659 --> 00:00:48.830
I got it.

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:51.163
There are no signs, so follow these steps.

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.770
- [Narrator] We got to
Madrid and followed the very

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.182
detailed instructions.

00:01:01.182 --> 00:01:03.030
Take notes people.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:03.867
Go to Plaza de España.

00:01:03.867 --> 00:01:04.700
- [Male] Check.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.960
- [Narrator] Get to the southeast corner.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.793
- [Male] Check.

00:01:06.793 --> 00:01:08.080
- [Narrator] Find the
parking lot entrance.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.150
Go down the stairs.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.090
- [Male] Double check.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.313
Oh, look a sign for the restaurant.

00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:13.550
- [Narrator] Remember, there are no signs.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:14.730
- [Male] Oh, yeah, I forgot.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.020
- [Narrator] Go down more stairs,

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.220
go through the corridor.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.053
Walk a bit.

00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:20.650
- [Male] Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.680
I think that's it.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.830
- [Narrator] And that's how
you find Cafetería Yulong Zhou,

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.123
better known as,

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.573
- [Narrator] Everyone meet
Yulong Zhou and Liufeng Zhu.

00:01:35.192 --> 00:01:37.700
- [Narrator] And these two
serve some of the most genuine

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.556
Chinese food in Spain.

00:01:39.556 --> 00:01:44.556
- [Male] Mmmmm that looks so good.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:53.370
- [Narrator] These
delicacies are not just your

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:54.920
average Chinese dumplings,

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.170
they're from the couple's
hometown Qingtang,

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:59.020
in the surrounding province Zhejiang,

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:00.490
in South Eastern China.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:02.660
It's actually where the
majority of Madrid's

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.413
Chinese population is from.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.960
- [Narrator] Like, really like it.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.230
For a restaurant that
was this hard to find,

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.703
it seems like this
place never stops going.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:28.783
- [Narrator] You got to tell
us who does your marketing.

00:02:34.526 --> 00:02:35.710
- [Male] Ahh, come on mate.

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:37.243
What about one for us?

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.420
- [Narrator] We'll take that as a maybe.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.800
Ah, that was totally worth the trouble.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.450
- [Male] Please can we stop filming now.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.883
I am really hungry.

